              "favorite_count": 22,
              "favorited": false,
              "full_text": "I built a LinkedIn scraper this afternoon that finds our next 1,000 waitlist signups. Total cost: about $5/month.\n\nHere's the playbook we're running at @GoodEnoughAi.\n\nWhen Google shipped Gemini 3.7 Flash yesterday, the entire comment section under the launch posts was engineers",
